{
  "revision": 3,
  "about": "The ADR-0049 decision 9 bake-off corpus (#1599): public pages of the classes ADR-0049 names, driven through the browser tools by the scripted bake-off agent (libs/rust/browser-session/tests/bakeoff.rs) on each engine. kind read: the page renders its key text; extract: a named fact is in the page's text; act: a sequence of tool calls changes the page. No task signs in, submits a form that sends data anywhere, or buys anything. A task whose expectation goes stale fails on every engine alike: fix the task in a reviewed change, never per engine.",
  "tasks": [
    { "id": "atlassian-support-confluence", "class": "atlassian", "kind": "read",
